      "text": "施法时间（释放速度）",
      "source": "$.title.zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "作用组件：cast、frequency、loop；条件 code：none",
      "source": "$.applicability"
    },
    {
      "text": "释放速度 = 基础释放速度 × (1 + Σincreased cast speed)，施法时间 = 1/释放速度；基础释放速度来自能力字段 animation_speed × speedMultiplier（公式形状经用户确认，基础常数未独立精确测量）。",
      "source": "$.applicability.notes"
    },
    {
      "text": "base_rate = animation_speed × speed_multiplier；cast_time = 1/(base_rate × (1+increased))。",
      "source": "$.handler_ref.note（le_calc.cooldown.compute_cast_time）"
    },
    {
      "text": "参数绑定（数值不在知识条目内，运行时从当前输入读取）：animation_speed、speed_multiplier、use_duration_s / use_delay_s、cast speed rows、cast time",
      "source": "$.parameter_bindings[].parameter"
    }
